  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#button-layout\r\n\r\n`display: run-in` is not implemented in current Chromium/WebKit/Gecko ([demo](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/7356)), but it's still [specified in css-display](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display/#run-in-layout).\r\n\r\nIf `run-in` is implemented, probably buttons should support it.\r\n\r\nA fix could be to override the inner display type to 'flow-root' except when it's grid or flex.\r\n\r\n@whatwg/rendering @whatwg/css ",
